          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: खड्डा",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खड्डा — khaḍḍā — \"a pothole; a pit\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पावसाळ्यात रस्त्यावर खूप खड्डे पडतात. pāvsāḷyāt rastyāvar khūp khaḍḍe paḍtāt. In the rainy season lots of potholes form on the road."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine. Plural: खड्डे, khaḍḍe."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खड्डा (khaḍḍā) पडणे, a pothole forms; the plural is खड्डे."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "खड्डा (khaḍḍā) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi khaḍḍā, \"rough hole, pit\", under khaḍḍa, \"hole, pit\" (CDIAL 3790)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
