            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A train? (आगगाडी, āggāḍī.) A rail? (रूळ, rūḷ.) A railway line? (लोहमार्ग, lohmārga.) A goods train? (मालगाडी, mālgāḍī.) To rattle? (खडखडणे, khaḍkhaḍṇe.) A delay? (विलंब, vilamb.) To be held up? (खोळंबणे, khoḷambṇe.) To be kept waiting? (ताटकळणे, tāṭkaḷṇe.) To be stalled? (रखडणे, rakhaḍṇe.) To set off? (रवाना होणे, ravānā hoṇe.) A ticket office? (तिकीटघर, tikīṭghar.) A travel pass? (पास, pās.) A refund? (परतावा, partāvā.) A destination? (गंतव्य, gantavya.) To set aside? (राखून ठेवणे, rākhūn ṭhevṇe.) A driver? (चालक, cālak.) A bus conductor? (वाहक, vāhak.) To drive? (चालवणे, cālavṇe.) A fellow traveller? (सहप्रवासी, sahapravāsī.) A wayfarer? (वाटसरू, vāṭsarū.) A vehicle? (वाहन, vāhan.) A two-wheeler? (दुचाकी, ducākī.) An autorickshaw? (रिक्षा, rikṣā.) A truck? (ट्रक, ṭrak.) To stuff in? (कोंबणे, kombṇe.) Fuel? (इंधन, indhan.) Petrol? (पेट्रोल, peṭrol.) A tyre? (टायर, ṭāyar.) A puncture? (पंक्चर, paṅkcar.) To run out? (संपणे, sampṇe.) A ghat road? (घाट, ghāṭ.) A narrow pass? (खिंड, khiṇḍ.) A downhill slope? (उतार, utār.) Winding? (नागमोडी, nāgmoḍī.) A rock pinnacle? (सुळका, suḷkā.) A pothole? (खड्डा, khaḍḍā.) A speed breaker? (गतिरोधक, gatirodhak.) Bumpy? (खडबडीत, khaḍbaḍīt.) To tip over? (कलंडणे, kalaṇḍṇe.) To bang against? (आपटणे, āpaṭṇe.)"
